{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S03→S04：S03想告诉对方自己有多喜欢这份亲近，念头却淡了；S04又回到想说出来、又怕说得太多破坏自在的状态。不过S04增加了想让这份亲近持续下去的愿望，属于有推进的重复。\",\n    \"S08→S09→S11→S13：对未来的期待反复被对方可能不再需要自己的恐惧打断。S09用眼下的亲近安慰自己，S10暂时放下，S11转向愿意无条件陪伴，S13又回到害怕失去和想收回心意。反复中逐渐出现了更深的自我接纳，因此不算原地打转。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02→S06：S02已经写过想靠近又怕太急、怕破坏自在；S06再次写时而想靠近、时而怕太贪心，基本重复了同一组进退矛盾。虽然增加了孤单感，但核心心理状态没有明显前进。\",\n    \"S02→S07：S02已经因为美好时刻终将过去而舍不得，S07又在意识到对方需要自己之后，重复出现眼前还好好却舍不得这一刻过去的感受。新发现没有充分转化成新的行动或认识。\",\n    \"S04→S08：S04已经产生不再收敛、坦白喜欢的强烈愿望，S05也已经让对方看见自己的在乎；S08又重新强调不想收着喜欢、大大方方回应，主动表达的心理决定有些重复，虽然增加了对方也主动靠近这一依据。\",\n    \"S08→S09→S10→S11→S13：对未来的乐观、害怕对方不再需要自己、决定只享受当下、重新想到未来的不确定、渴望保证并想收回心意，形成多次往返。S09和S11虽增加了对方也能从亲近中获得安心的认识，但后续仍反复落回相似的失去焦虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y的问题主要集中在中段：S06重新演了一遍S02的靠近与退缩，S07又重复S02的离别预感，使情绪没有持续向前。X也有对表达犹豫和未来失去的反复，但更多是在前一次经历上增加认识、改变立场，整体探索感更强。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "99f3933e-7624-4a8b-98cc-5ef1fc14961d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T100813269213Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:09:06.006145+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff4d8ec7f93c8adf0974d29ff509007d8110aa0e150b73f7add47c38cac678da", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T100813269213Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "867b54042428d31992fd00d523c002d5f4f49283fe6cbff6ba37a4cf888e24f0"}}}
